menuconfig ENABLE_ENERGY_OVERCHARGE
    bool
    prompt "Electricity energy overcharge config enable"
    default y
    help
    是否打开过充保护功能

if (ENABLE_ENERGY_OVERCHARGE)

config ENERGY_METER_OVERCHARGE_DPID
    int
    prompt "overcharge DPID"
    range 1 999
    default 51
    help
    过充保护 DPID

config OVERCHARGE_POWER_THRESHOLD
    int
    prompt "overcharge power threshold (w)"
    range 1 20
    default 3
    help
    过充保护功率下限，低于此阈值一段时间后会关闭插座

config OVERCHARGE_DURATION_MINS
    int
    prompt "overcharge low power duration time(mins)"
    range 1 120
    default 40
    help
    如果插座实时功率在这么长时间之内一直低于阈值，那么就会断开插座继电器

endif